  "id": "decision-record-screening",
  "label": "S7 decision_record(decision_scope=SCREENING)（D-95 IN_CHAT v2，真实写库）",
  "tool": {
    "name": "recruitment_decision_record",
    "description": "Formal decision record for ONE application: decision_scope=SCREENING (S7, stage_code=S7, no interview_id and no S10 summary) or STAGE/FINAL (S10, stage_code=S10). The decision itself is made by a HUMAN; this tool only verifies and records it: for S10 it re-computes the evaluation summary (same as_of) and enforces the result gate (WITHDRAW/HOLD always allowed; ADVANCE(FINAL)/REJECT blocked when required scorecards are missing); for S7 it only checks the screening-evaluation binding. It requires human_confirmation whose sha256 covers {result, reason, override_rationale, basis_refs} (plus the human's verbatim words for IN_CHAT, D-95), asks the human for approval when the confirmation is not IN_CHAT (no answerer => unavailable => nothing is written), then writes one decision row plus its internal event in the same transaction (supersede = reverse-insert, rewire, clear). It never writes application/interview status and accepts no tenant/actor/stage_code input.",
