          "enum": [
            "SCREENING",
            "STAGE",
            "FINAL"
          ],
          "description": "STAGE 必须带 interview_id；FINAL 必须不带（DC-06）；SCREENING 是 S7 的人决定（不需要 interview_id / S10 汇总，stage_code 写 S7，§17.1）"
        },
